--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. ANIMATION TIMELINE REGISTRY:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A. [Anim_SettingsEnter] (Duration: 0.25s):
   - Track: SettingsMainModal.RenderScale (Key 0.0s: (0.95, 0.95) -> Key 0.25s: (1.0, 1.0))
   - Track: SettingsMainModal.RenderOpacity (Key 0.0s: 0.0 -> Key 0.2s: 1.0)

B. [Anim_TabSwitch] (Duration: 0.15s):
   - Smooth horizontal slide of active page indicator line.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. SOUND BINDINGS:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   - SFX_Hover: SoundCue'/Game/Audio/UI/SC_UI_Hover'
   - SFX_Click: SoundCue'/Game/Audio/UI/SC_UI_Click'
   - SFX_SliderTick: SoundCue'/Game/Audio/UI/SC_UI_SliderTick'
   - SFX_SaveSuccess: SoundCue'/Game/Audio/UI/SC_UI_SaveConfirm'

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. C++ METHOD CALLS & EVENT GRAPH:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Variables:
   - TargetGameInstance: UVELOCITYXGameInstance

Event Construct:
   1. TargetGameInstance = Cast<UVELOCITYXGameInstance>(GetGameInstance())
   2. Play Sound 2D (SFX_Hover)
   3. Play Animation (Anim_SettingsEnter)
   4. Call LoadValuesFromGameInstance()

Function LoadValuesFromGameInstance():
   If (!IsValid(TargetGameInstance)) Return;
   1. Graphics Tab:
      - Slider_GraphicsQuality->SetValue((float)TargetGameInstance->GraphicsQuality) // EGraphicsQuality (0..3)
      - Check_MotionBlur->SetIsChecked(TargetGameInstance->bMotionBlur)
      - Check_AntiAliasing->SetIsChecked(TargetGameInstance->bAntiAliasing)
      - Slider_FOV->SetValue(TargetGameInstance->FieldOfView)
      - Update Text Labels (Txt_GfxQualityVal, Txt_FOVVal)
   2. Audio Tab:
      - Slider_MasterVol->SetValue(TargetGameInstance->MasterVolume)
      - Slider_SFXVol->SetValue(TargetGameInstance->SFXVolume)
      - Slider_MusicVol->SetValue(TargetGameInstance->MusicVolume)
      - Update Volume Percent Text Labels

On Clicked (Btn_ResetDefaults):
   1. Play Sound 2D (SFX_Click)
   2. If (IsValid(TargetGameInstance)):
      - TargetGameInstance->ApplyDefaultSettings()
      - LoadValuesFromGameInstance()

On Clicked (Btn_ApplyAndSave):
   1. Play Sound 2D (SFX_SaveSuccess)
   2. If (IsValid(TargetGameInstance)):
      - TargetGameInstance->GraphicsQuality = (EGraphicsQuality)RoundToInt(Slider_GraphicsQuality->GetValue())
      - TargetGameInstance->bMotionBlur = Check_MotionBlur->IsChecked()
      - TargetGameInstance->bAntiAliasing = Check_AntiAliasing->IsChecked()
      - TargetGameInstance->FieldOfView = Slider_FOV->GetValue()
      - TargetGameInstance->MasterVolume = Slider_MasterVol->GetValue()
      - TargetGameInstance->SFXVolume = Slider_SFXVol->GetValue()
      - TargetGameInstance->MusicVolume = Slider_MusicVol->GetValue()
      - TargetGameInstance->SaveGameData() // Flushes to savegame.json
   3. Remove from Parent (Self)

On Clicked (Btn_Cancel / Btn_CloseCross):
   1. Play Sound 2D (SFX_Click)
   2. Remove from Parent (Self)
================================================================================
*/
